# Build the elf mage who casts Phantasmal Force through Creature::Cast, and SAVE
# him. inc-z1ba. This script makes tools/fixtures/chars/elf-mage-spotted-seed1.sav.
# It is not a check; tools/check_illusion_spotted.sh loads the fixture.
#
# The Illusion specialty is granted Phantasmal Force outright at generation
# (tools/keys/school-focus.keys). The spell is therefore known the ordinary way
# and is NOT innate, so a player cast goes to EV_CAST (src/Player.cpp:1073) and
# reaches Creature::Cast, where the Spellcraft identifiers are decided. The
# sibling fixture elf-mage-illusions-seed1 learns its spells through wizard
# mode, which marks them innate and sends them to Creature::Invoke.

@include chargen-elf-mage.keys
ESC

ESC b           # System Menu, [b] Save and Continue (tools/fixtures/README.md).
